          "parts": [
            "So I want to spitball some ideas for creating a name for my website that will catch well in searches for the service I intend to provide I intend to provide a service to do salon quality nails on short notice in 10 minutes with a requirement that you provide a mold of your fingers so that I can hand craft the acrylic and make the nails and then hold them  for you till it's necessary. The day I make your mold I'll craft you a couple sets of nails with whatever coverage you prefer for your tip. And acrylic molded powder for the remainder of the nail for strength. Durability in the absorption factor has with the glue so that the nail really adheres much more strongly with a with a mold on file. Never have to wait more than 10 minutes to have a perfect set of nails plus travel time from wherever the hell I happened to be"
          ]
